{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> \ud83d\udc3e<br>Welcome to <i>Cozy Farm</i>, a charming farm sim where you play as <strong>Cozy the Cat</strong>, a hardworking feline with a love for the land! Plant crops, raise animals, and build your dream farm\u2014all while managing your day in this somewhat realistic, heartwarming farming simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d Grow crops like corn, potatoes, grass, and turnips<br>\ud83d\udc13 Care for cows, sheep, and chickens<br>\u26cf\ufe0f Mine ore, collect wild honey, and forage for cherries<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade your tools and expand your farm<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell animal products, crops, and resources to grow your farm even bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each day, you'll need to manage your time wisely\u2014should you harvest turnips, care for your chickens, or head to the mines? It\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re tending to animals, upgrading your gear, or just enjoying the peaceful rhythm of country life, <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> is the purr-fect escape for players who love relaxing sim games with a dash of strategy and a whole lot of charm.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736040/873819c3bd11f5d975e05c5ac9a21c5f8dcacc55.jpg"},{"name":"Small Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736040/5d6d95257f11f183ae7c94155d00c259e6428464.jpg"},{"name":"Big Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736040/0f3a83e1372a0fd110d0069d81b33597a49669eb.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Kitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736040/fbc60c13483f7d7194edb3b83a156e40acb3409b.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Kitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736040/d4965f4956694229